00:00:17.751 --> 00:00:20.721 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Deux semaines plus tard,

00:00:18.852 --> 00:00:21.855 size:53% position:73% line:53%
la DPJ installe les adolescentes

00:00:19.953 --> 00:00:22.956 size:53% position:73% line:53%
dans cet hôtel de Blainville.

00:00:21.054 --> 00:00:23.991 size:53% position:73% line:53%
MYRIAM BRIAND, directrice, DPJ,

00:00:22.189 --> 00:00:24.024 size:53% position:73% line:53%
CISSS des Laurentides

00:00:23.290 --> 00:00:24.057 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- C'est une entrée indépendante,

00:00:24.391 --> 00:00:27.427 size:53% position:73% line:53%
notre unité de désengorgement

00:00:25.525 --> 00:00:28.528 size:53% position:73% line:53%
