00:01:58.752 --> 00:02:01.588 size:53% position:73% line:53%
la situation n'est pas idéale,

00:01:59.819 --> 00:02:02.656 size:53% position:73% line:53%
mais précise que p

00:02:00.887 --> 00:02:03.857 size:53% position:73% line:53%
les ressources débordent,

00:02:01.922 --> 00:02:06.660 size:53% position:73% line:53%
